{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/323935/", "pk": 323935, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/", "pk": 929, "shortname": "livingoceanscuba", "name": "Living Ocean Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Waikiki Sunset Cruise BYOB", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 12, "unicode": "Waikiki Sunset Cruise BYOB", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.5, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.5, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 12562, "description": "##From January through March our sunset cruise is the best way to go whale watching! Hawaii is well known for its majestic sunsets, and there is truly no better way to experience it than on a boat out at sea. \n\n##Duration\n1.5 Hours \n\n\n##About\n\nCome cruise the beautiful Waikiki coastline on our brand new boat! With an upper and lower deck and plenty of room on the bow, we offer many different vantage points for sunset viewing.\n\nOur cruise is for guests age 3 and up and is BYOB for guests 21 and over (no glass please). Bring your family or a date and spend a gorgeous evening out on the tropical waters of Oahu!\n\n##About the Boat\n- 50ft Custom Built Passenger Vessel\n- 40 Passenger Maximum Capacity\n- Shaded and Sunny Areas\n- Toilet On Board\n- Seating for 10 on Upper Deck \n- Seating for 40 on Main Deck (Half Sun / Half Shade)\n- Standing / Floor Seating for 10 on Bow (Full Sun)\n\n###What's Included\n- Cold Drinks (Juices and Sodas)\n- Water\n- Light Snacks\n\n###Additional Information\n\n**Weather Cancellation** - In the event of unsafe weather or heavy rain we will cancel the tour. We will notify guests via email and text message (if a text message capable phone number has been provided) as soon as the cancellation is made. You will have the option of rescheduling (based on availability) or a full refund.\n\n**Sea Sickness** - Generally the ocean is calm near Waikiki, but if you are prone to sea sickness or are not accustomed to being aboard ocean going boats we suggest you consult your doctor or pharmacist about taking preventative measures prior to your trip.\n\n**Departure Time / Late Arrivals**  - Out of respect to our guests we attempt to leave on time for every trip. If you are running late and do not arrive at the boat prior to the start of the passenger safety briefing your ticket will be forfeited. Refunds cannot be processed for no-shows / late arrivals so please plan ahead and arrive on time.\n\n**Parking** - Parking is available at Kewalo Basin Boat Harbor for $2 per hour. Pay machines accept cash and credit card. Please refer to the Kewalo Basin Boat Harbor Map below and in your confirmation email for parking areas and our boat's location.\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/alsYpPIOTR7cbCtNKMLQ)", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##What to Bring\n- ID If You Will Be Consuming Alcohol (21+)\n- Hat, Sunglasses, Sunscreen\n- Non-Alcoholic Beverages Included, BYOB for Adult Beverages (21+)\n- Cameras\n- Crew Gratuity (not required)\n\n###NO GLASS CONTAINERS WILL BE PERMITTED ONBOARD \n - Please bring cans or transfer your beverages into a plastic or metal water-bottle prior to arriving at the boat.\n\n###Additional Information\n\n**Sea Sickness** - Generally the ocean is calm near Waikiki, but if you are prone to sea sickness or are not accustomed to being aboard ocean going boats we suggest you consult your doctor or pharmacist about taking preventative measures prior to your trip.\n\n**Departure Time / Late Arrivals**  - Out of respect to our guests we attempt to leave on time for every trip. If you are running late and do not arrive at the boat prior to the scheduled departure time your ticket will be forfeited. Refunds cannot be processed for no-shows / late arrivals so please plan ahead and arrive on time.\n\n*Refund Requests*\n\nIf you would like to request a refund due to unforeseen circumstances please visit our partner [TourClaim](https://link.getcopernican.com/livingoceanscuba) and submit a refund request.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "The best way to experience a Hawaiian sunset", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/323935/images/619727/", "pk": 619727, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/AxyZS9ASP2dRkSjqPiQl", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/AxyZS9ASP2dRkSjqPiQl", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/323935/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/AxyZS9ASP2dRkSjqPiQl", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/AxyZS9ASP2dRkSjqPiQl", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/323935/images/1573143/", "pk": 1573143, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nZ3T8JidRoGmS